{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"97875","name":"Convenient Park Bangkok Sukhumvit","description":"يقع فندق Convenient Park Bangkok Sukhumvit في منطقة Sukhumvit النابضة بالحياة، وهو فندق عصري يتميز بتصميم معماري حديث. سيجد ضيوفنا خيارات ترفيه وتسوق وطعام متنوعة في هذه المنطقة. يقع الفندق بالقرب من محطة On Nut Sky Train، على بُعد حوالي 10 دقائق بالحافلة. يضم الفندق العديد من المساحات العامة لراحة النزلاء، ويحتوي على غرف عصرية بديكورات مريحة. يرحب الفندق بضيوفه بحفاوة ودود وخدمة احترافية، وهو مناسب للمسافرين بغرض العمل أو الترفيه.","address":"12 Soi Sukhumvit 62/3","city":"BANGKOK","countryCode":"TH","postalCode":"10260","lat":13.688742,"lng":100.608195,"stars":3,"chain":"CONVE","giataCode":"102346","phone":"+6627416710","email":"info@convenientpark.com","website":"www.convenientpark.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/097875/097875a_hb_a_001.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/097875/097875a_hb_a_002.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/097875/097875a_hb_a_005.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/097875/097875a_hb_a_006.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/097875/097875a_hb_a_003.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/097875/097875a_hb_a_004.jpg","category":"exterior","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/097875/097875a_hb_l_006.jpg","category":"lobby","order":6},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/097875/097875a_hb_l_007.jpg","category":"lobby","order":7},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/097875/097875a_hb_l_008.jpg","category":"lobby","order":8},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/097875/097875a_hb_l_009.jpg","category":"lobby","order":9},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bi